      "typical_award_size": "HHAP-6 allocations: County of San Joaquin $5,399,638.58 and San Joaquin Continuum of Care $5,766,906.84 (City of Stockton receives its own share; the regional HHAP-6 plan totals $22,698,332.21). Regional HHAP-6 budget: permanent housing 18% (rapid rehousing and services, $2,042,849.90 each for the County and CoC lines), homeless prevention $4.1 million, interim housing $10.4 million, youth set-aside $2.27 million, administration $1.8 million, capital $0. HHAP-5 local awards: 30 agreements totaling $6,430,416.36 approved March 3, 2026 for March 3, 2026 through June 30, 2028, plus $1,000,000 HHAP-5 to the SJ BeWell Tiny Home Village.",
